# GIMP gimprc — seeded once by the W graphics bundle (w-pack, class `user`):
# GIMP rewrites this file itself on exit, keeping these values. Two settings
# make GIMP follow the W theme instead of its own dark look:
#   theme "System"             GTK-themed chrome — the W gtk theme (w-gtk)
#   theme-color-scheme system  light/dark from GTK's prefer-dark (W appearance axis)
# Verified against GIMP 3.2.4: the `prefer-dark-theme` key the system gimprc
# still documents is stale and fails the parser (the whole file is then ignored
# and backed up as gimprc~) — do not add it.

(theme "System")
(theme-color-scheme system)
